e to fight  cancer  and in 2019 nene opened up to e.t about  sharing that journey on tv  what was it like to get the response  from the fans and the viewers who are  maybe going through the same thing you  and greg and your family is going well i  can say that i had a lot of fans to  reach out to me caretakers were emailing  me left and right saying we understand  what you are going through now there  were people who did not understand what  a caretaker role is or they just didn't  understand me saying i was frustrated  they were like why are you frustrated  you're not the one with cancer but you  know i was frustrated because i was a  caretaker

